comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-30T15:31:16.878Z","harness:claude-code","Implementation on branch ci/bounded-pr-runner-demand. ci.yml: build-test is now 'Packed runtime (<os>)' x3 (ubuntu/macos/windows). Each runs packed first run on Node 22.18.0 then 24 in separate prefix/cache/home roots (pm-first-run-node<version>) before any dependency install, the dist version smoke on 24, then platform proofs: ubuntu = Node 22 telemetry + linked snapshot regressions (Node 22 setup, pnpm install under 22), macOS = registry/completion/merge settlement/portability, Windows = full npm npx + Bun bunx acceptance (timeout 25). Jobs first-run and node22-telemetry removed. gates matrix static+smokes: typecheck step moved to static, compatibility-check and workspace-compatibility moved to smokes; static no longer runs pnpm contracts:check / pnpm sdk:surface:check directly because pnpm lint (quality:static) runs contracts-snapshot, capability surfaces, error catalog and sdk-surface-snapshot checks. windows-regression-cohorts lost max-parallel 2. Per-push CI jobs 25 -> 15 (all PR workflows 33 -> 23; macOS jobs 3 -> 1, Windows 5 -> 4). gate-registry.json drops ci.yml#first-run and ci.yml#node22-telemetry (both gates already list ci.yml#build-test); defect-recurrence-policy renames CI / Runtime smoke (macos-latest, Node 24) to CI / Packed runtime (macos-latest). Docs: TESTING.md gains 'CI Job Layout and Runner Budget', PACKED_FIRST_RUN.md names the per-OS job."
  "2026-10-30T15:31:17.592Z","harness:claude-code","Local evidence: actionlint 1.7.12 clean on ci.yml; ci-workflow-contract (24), node22-telemetry-workflow (1), packed-first-run (5), gate-registry (9), workflow-inventory (3), release-automation-contract (25), codecov-verified-upload (3) all pass; node scripts/release/gate-registry.mjs exit 0; docs-skills-gate, check-workflow-permissions, lint:duplicates (0 clones), eslint on changed specs, pnpm typecheck, security:scan, changelog:pm:check pass; tracker assurance gates pass. Negative control: the updated contract tests run against origin/main's ci.yml fail 4 tests (Windows max-parallel cap, gate matrix/runtime layout, Node 22 telemetry ownership, per-OS packed first runs)."
  "2026-10-30T18:54:42.757Z","harness:claude-code","Hosted run 41081552276 on 049a2ba36 (all 30 checks green). Wall clock 15:31-18:29 UTC was almost entirely runner queueing: per-job queue waits ran from 1.8 to 112.5 minutes while the account pool was saturated. Job run times: Build foundation 1.3 min; Packed runtime ubuntu 1.6, macos 2.0, windows 17.8; Gates static 13.8, smokes 11.2, coverage aggregate 0.8; Coverage shards 5.0 to 7.2; Windows regression cohorts 5.7 to 6.8. Uncontended critical path is Build foundation plus Packed runtime (windows-latest), about 19 minutes; the static gate path is about 15 minutes. The Windows packed job is now the longest single job and the first candidate if the 20-minute budget tightens."
close_reason: "PR CI runs 15 jobs per push with every packed proof preserved, merged in #1634"
